        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Danja, J. Cole\n- Roles: record producer, rapper\n- Places: Fayetteville, North Carolina\n- Works: The Come Up\n- Topics: artists produced for, early career recognition\n\nFacts:\n- In early 2007, J. Cole gained initial recognition as a rapper after releasing his debut mixtape, \"The Come Up.\"\n- J. Cole was raised in Fayetteville, North Carolina.\n- Danja has produced songs for artists including Justin Bieber, Monica, Britney Spears, Usher, Keri Hilson, T.I., Nelly Furtado, Kevin Cossom, Ciara, Mariah Carey, Timbaland, Madonna, J. Cole, Kanye West, Whitney Houston, Missy Elliott, M.I.A., Justin Timberlake, JoJo, Joe Jonas, Simple Plan, The Clutch, Pink, T-Pain, Diddy, Meek Mill, Björk, and Duran Duran.",
